msgstr "Analytics-Backend (OpenSearch):"

msgid "Create a new OpenSearch domain"
msgstr "Eine neue OpenSearch-Domain erstellen"

msgid "Re-use an existing OpenSearch domain in this VPC"
msgstr "Verwenden Sie eine vorhandene OpenSearch-Domain in dieser VPC erneut"

